[344.23,"o","rune hook: the working-copy commit vwuqsppxsnnr is empty, undescribed, and this workspace's alone, so it takes the session's author\r\nrune hook: git keeps one config for every worktree of this repository: core.worktree is set in .git/config, and extensions.worktreeConfig needs the key moved into config.worktree by hand first. No git identity was written: the one file left is the shared .git/config, which every worktree of the repository reads. A raw git commit here carries the global git identity; a jj commit carries the session's\r\n"]
